    "slug": "tempmail-xyz-dispomail-xyz-free-temporary-email-guide",
    "title": "Dispomail, Disposalmail, Disposmail: Which Service Is This?",
    "excerpt": "Many people find DisposeMail by typing dispomail, disposalmail or disposmail. This is what each spelling means, who we are, and how to avoid copycat sites.",
